timeline.body:
I think it doesn't worth to create an extra class for this simple logic. I think it should be enough to add this logic in `DefaultHighlighter` and `PlainHighlighter`:

```
Integer queryMaxAnalyzedOffset = fieldContext.field.fieldOptions().maxAnalyzedOffset();
if ((queryMaxAnalyzedOffset !=null) && (queryMaxAnalyzedOffset == -1)) {
     queryMaxAnalyzedOffset = maxAnalyzedOffset;
}
```

and in this case, the overall changes because of this PR would  be smaller.

What do you think?

